ind":"announcement","title":"HUMAN MADE","summary":"In light of all the generative AI games being featured in this October Steam Next Fest, we would like to take the opportunity to reassure players that DESKRAGE has never and WILL never use generative AI.If we want to make my game look like slop, we would rather do it by hand, like real humans!!! Generative AI is destroying not only our planet but our humanity!!!Please go and support all the other indie developers who have put their heart, soul and HUMAN EXPEREINCE into their games","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:46:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029985","verified_at":"2026-10-21T22:05:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3575280-1825093633188196","game_id":"steam-3575280","kind":"announcement","title":"New Level & More","summary":"Hello all, We have been hard at work on Build A Bot and I’d like to introduce some of the new content in our upcoming demo update :DNew Level In this update we are introducing the capital city “New Unity” :D Battle through the streets of the New Unity as it is in a military takeover by Mega-Corp. This level will sport large play areas, which is a good starting point for newer players!Mini BossesEach level in Build A Bot will have a unique level boss AND a mini boss!!! Here is a sneak peak at the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-20T15:46:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633188196","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3575280-1806064758649926","game_id":"steam-3575280","kind":"announcement","title":"Build a Bot Demo Release!","summary":"The Demo is now live!We at DESKRAGE are happy to finally get out a free demo of Build a Bot into your hands! It's intended as a sneak preview of what we are working on and we may throw an update or two when we have something interesting to show.So...What is in the Demo?Most of the second level of the game including one of the bosses from the game8 Gun options to mix and matchA good pile of chips to make your own unique builds5 enemy types to test you mettle against3 room types: Extermination, Su","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-25T17:57:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806064758649926","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3575280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:33Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:32Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3575280":"2026-10-26T10:39:33Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3575280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:32Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:32Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:32Z"},"3889730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:33Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:33Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:33Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3575280","app_id":3575280,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:18Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"b8706cc6bdcef17723760daa87d8205afa44f89b3803b8ffc55a4e6f3e879760","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A top-down shooter rogue-like that sees its player take control of a mechanized weapons platform designed for one thing and one thing only: “Take down the 